      "locked": false,
      "text": "we ask for 4× more than we need, because several facts\ncollapse onto the same message and we still want 10 distinct ones.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "we ask for 4× more than we need, because several facts\ncollapse onto the same message and we still want 10 distinct ones.",
